 style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 11pt;\">학년</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 11pt;\">)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 11pt;\">이상을 이수</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt;\">하고</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt;\">평점평균이&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">2.6&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt;\">이상인 자</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 46.8pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -46.8pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 46.8pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -46.8pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">2.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">공인외국어성적표 입력</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">학생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">및 접수 승인 기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">행정실</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">)&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">:</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">2025. 7. 1.(화</span></u><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">) ~ 11.(금</span></u><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">)&nbsp;</span></u></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 22.3pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 22.4px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -22.3pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">학생역량관리시스템</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;HCI Poppy&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">(BISkit)</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">에 승인된 공인외국어성적이 없을 경우는 공인외국어성적표를 등록하고 학과의</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"