ndent: -81pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">까지</span></u><u style=\"text-indent: -81pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">(</span></u><u style=\"text-indent: -81pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">기한엄수</span></u><u style=\"text-indent: -81pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">)</span></u></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 81pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold; word-break: break-all; text-indent: -81pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 19.3pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -19.3pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">4.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">제출점수 입력방법&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">:</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 11pt;\">원킷-통합정보시스템</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 11pt;\">-학사행정-장학</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 11pt;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; let