-46.8pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt;\">가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt;\">다음과 같은 평가 점수가 우수한자 순</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 46.8pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -46.8pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">평가 점수&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">= 100×(</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">제출점수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">기준점수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">)/(1100-</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">제출점수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">)+(</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">제출점수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">기준점수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">)/5</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 46.8pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -46.8pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 300; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 14.6667px; text-indent: -43.3333px;\">⇒</span><span style=\"font-weight: 300; text-indent: -62.4px; font-size: 14.6667px;\">기준점수, 제출점수가 있어야 평가대상이 됩니다.(※ 제출점수는 기준점수보다 높아야 평가점수가 높게나옴)</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 46.8pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -46.8pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt;\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt;\">학부 및 전공과 무관하게 평가점수 우수자 순으로 선발</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 32.5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -32.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt;\">다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 11pt;\">외국어와 관련된 교내외 타 장학금과 중복 지급은 불가능하나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 11pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 11pt;\">이 외 타 장학금과는 중복 가능</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 32.5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -32.5pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">등록금 범위 내에 중복 가능</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 32.5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -32.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">⇒</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">등록금 전액을 장학금으로 받은 경우 외국어성적우수장학생으로 선발하지 않음</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 31.1pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -31.1pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt;\">라</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">2025-1</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">학기 외국어성적우수장학금 신청자 중&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">2</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">025-1</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">학기 기준점수와 제출점수가 이전에 수혜한 외국어성적우수장학금 제출점수보다 낮은 학생은 장학금 지급대상에서 제외</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 32.5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-weight: bold; word-break: break-all; text-indent: -32.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 46.8pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -46.8pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">6.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">장학 금액 및 지급 시기</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 46.8pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -46.8pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt;\">가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt;\">장학금액&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">: 400,000</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt;\">원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">/</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt;\">학기</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">/</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt;\">등록금범위내 이중수혜가능</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 31.7pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -31.7pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt;\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt;\">지급시기&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">: 2025</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt;\">년&nbsp;8</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt;\">월 중 지급</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 46.8pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(0, 0, 255); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -46.8pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 46.8pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -46.8pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">7.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">기타</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 31.8pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -31.8pt;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">.</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">2025년</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;1~2</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">월에 외국어성적우수장학금을 신청한</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">기준점수 제출자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">)</span></b><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><b>학생만 신청가능</b></span>&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-size: 11pt;\">※&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-size: 11pt;\">붙임 참조</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 31.8pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -31.8pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt;\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">. 2025-2</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt;\">학기 외국어성적우수장학금 신청기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt;\">기준점수 제출</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt;\">은 별도 공지 예정</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 31.8pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -31.8pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">다. 공인외국어성적만 인정(모의토익 인정안됨)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 31.8pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -31.8pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 31.3pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -31.3pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt;\">붙임&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">1.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt;\">외국어성적우수장학금&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">‘</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt;\">제출점수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">’&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt;\">입력방법&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt;\">부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 32px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-align: center;\"></p><div id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"53259\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"></div><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 31.3pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -31.3pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">2.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt;\">외국어성적우수장학금지급기준 및 선발절차&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt;\">부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">.</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
